    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amakhuwa kobulaatne bwaYoswa khuIsiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyuma lwetsindaalo tsinyinji, olwa OMWAMI yali nahuluusiye Isiraeli khubasuku bosi abababotokhana, naye Yoswa nakofuule nali omuyindifu owemiyika eminji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa yalanga Isiraeli yosi, abakofu babwe nabeemilisi babwe, nabayaasii babwe nabasinjilili babwe, nababoolela bari Isie engofuule; endi omuyindifu owemiyika eminji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neenyu mwaluutsi kosi aka OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe yakholela amahanga kano kosi khulweenywe; okhuba OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe niye owamulwanilanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, emulaamila amahanga ako akashitong'a, kabe obulaame bwetsimbia tsieenywe, halala namahanga aka emalile okhwakamia, okhurula khuYorodani okhuula khunyanza ikhongo, ewa eliuba liyeelelanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe niye oulabasindikha barule imbeli weenywe, nabeelusia barule mumoni tsieenywe; neenyu mulalia eshialo shiabwe, shinga OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe olwa yamuboolela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho muume ikholo muno okhulinda nekhukhola kosi akahandiikwa mushitabu shiamalako kaMusa, muleshe okhwibera okhurula muko, khumukhono musaatsa kata omukhasi ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muleshe okhwitsoka mumahanga kano, mbu kano akashisikaale hakari weenywe, ta; kata murarumbulakhwo ameera kabanyasaye babwe, kata okhwitsuba khubo, kata okhubakhalabanila, kata okhubeenamila ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa muhande khuMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe shinga olwa mwakholilenje okhuula olwa leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba OMWAMI yarusia imbeli weenywe amahanga amakhongo akamaani; kata inywe, abulaho omundu owasinjila imbeli weenywe oklhuula olwa leelo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu mulala khwinywe yeelusia eshikhumila, okhuba OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe niye oumulwanila, shinga olwa yamuboolela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mwirecheshe muno, muheelenje OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa nimuba nimukalukhakhwo inyuma, nimwiyunga khumusikalo kwamahanga kano, mbu kano akashisikaale hakari weenywe, nimukhweelelana ninabo, nimuleera abakhaana babwe, nabo nibaleera abeenywe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho mumanye tieri mbu OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe shialarusinjia amahanga kano karule mumoni tsieenywe khandi ta; ne balamubeelanga obuliba nende omubero, olukhoba khumukongo namahwa mubilenje, okhuula olwa mulasishila mushialo shino eshilayi eshia OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe yamuha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Iole, isie bulaano endi okhulonda khunjila eya abandu bosi balondakhwo; inywe nmumanyile mumioyo chieenywe mwesi kata nende muroho tsieenywe, mbu shiliachweya okhwikhola likhuwa kata elala ta, khumalayi ako kosi aka OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe yaboola khwinywe; ako kosi kamwikholeele; shiliachweya okhwikhola kata elala khuko ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shinga amalayi kosi olwa kamwitsiile, aka OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe yamuboolelakhwo, nolwa OMWAMI alamukwisilia amabii kosi, okhuula olwa alaba namusishiye mushialo shino eshilayi eshia OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe yamuha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa muba nimukhaya indakano yOMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe, eya yamulaka, nimutsia okhukhalabanila abanyasaye bandi, nimubeenamila, kho oburima bwOMWAMI bulamwashila, neenyu nimusishila bwangu mushialo eshilayi eshia yamuha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
